    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through the darkness of the night as you decided that midnight is the perfect time for such a drive. Survive against ghosts, parked cars, and your own haunted car that all have it out for your life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels of increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts and other hazards with randomized spawning based on difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy 3D models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One final custom route that allows you to select desired difficulty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all 5 routes, then set out on the custom route to aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game made, so I apologize for the jank of it. I simply wanted to put forth an idea that I had, but I didn't really have the skills, time, or resources to make it great. If this game is something that gains support and love, it would be an honor to put much more time into making a sequel with ideas that didn't make it into this one. Have fun :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through the darkness of the night as you decided that midnight is the perfect time for such a drive. Survive against ghosts, parked cars, and your own haunted car that all have it out for your life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels of increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts and other hazards with randomized spawning based on difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goofy 3D models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One final custom route that allows you to select desired difficulty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all 5 routes, then set out on the custom route to aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game made, so I apologize for the jank of it. I simply wanted to put forth an idea that I had, but I didn't really have the skills, time, or resources to make it great. If this game is something that gains support and love, it would be an honor to put much more time into making a sequel with ideas that didn't make it into this one. Have fun :)</p>",
    "short_description": "It is the dead of night and you decided it would be a nice time for a drive. Little did you know... it would be a spooky drive. Pay attention to all surroundings in this goofy &quot;horror&quot; game, or else it will spell your doom.",
